      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOLDEN FIRE NZ (1) has done a great job to place against the good mares at her last two outings, coming from this barrier to miss by 1.7m in the Fleur De Lil before a third in last week's Golden Girl. The two mares that finished in front of her in that race aren't here and she should get her chance from the ace draw. BELLA DANZA (5) had little go her way from the back row in the Golden Girl but did a great job to come from that row and beat Eye Keep Smiling in winning the Fleur de Lil prior. Returns to the front row so could bounce back. Former Kiwi TYTATE NZ (6) was a beaten favourite last time but was runner-up from a similar barrier to this in her Brisbane debut. Her best NZ form measures right up here. LUVARESCHS (2) has won two of her last three here and draws to be competitive again while TREMENDOUS SENSATION NZ (3) did well to finish fifth from the back line in the Golden Girl and draws better.",
